# This repository is a SHOWCASE, not a delivery mechanism.
#
# It must never contain OmniBlock's source code, a build, or an installer.
# OmniBlock is donationware: builds go directly to supporters, with the
# complete source alongside every build as the GPL requires. Publishing
# either here would defeat that.
#
# A .gitignore only stops an accidental `git add .` -- the real guard is
# `node tools/check-public-repo.mjs` in the source repository, which fails
# loudly if any of this ever lands here. Run it before every publish.

# --- builds, packages, installers -------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.xpi
*.crx
*.exe
*.msi
*.7z
*.tar.gz
.output/
dist/
build/
artifacts/

# --- source and toolchain ---------------------------------------------------
src/
tools/
node_modules/
*.ts
*.svelte
*.mjs
package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
wxt.config.*
tsconfig*.json
manifest.json

# --- noise ------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
